Error [E0712]: this `#FX` region uses the effect `FS`, which it has no authority for
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_nonce_region_authority_precedence.jet:6:15
    |
  6 |     #FX(Net) {
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: `#FX(…)` allows only `Net`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: add `FS` to the `#FX(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0712
